    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Describing a building",
     "texto": [
      "To describe a place, you can say **Bangunan ini memiliki ruang tunggu** (\"This building has a waiting room\") or **Klinik berfungsi untuk layanan kesehatan** (\"The clinic serves to provide health services\")."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Public places",
     "texto": [
      "**Fasilitas umum** are spaces or services used by the public. The name of the place is usually enough to say what service it offers."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
